<title>MEXICO: Foreign investment in Mexico securities up in Dec.</title>
<headline>Foreign investment in Mexico securities up in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rose 4.11 percent in December to $34.19 billion from $32.84 billion in November, the Mexican Stock Exchange (BMV) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Over the year investment grew 22.74 percent, compared with Dec. 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Total foreign investment in stocks grew 4.07 percent over the month to $30.98 billion, and year-on-year it was up 26.36 percent. In the money market, foreign investment rose 4.46 percent in December to $3.21 billion, and over the year it was down 3.85 percent.  </p>
